# Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# API requests are handled by Cloudflare Functions automatically because
# the files live under /functions. No rewrites needed for them.
#
# We deliberately do NOT rewrite /admin/ — Cloudflare Pages will serve
# /admin/index.html directly, which is the login page. The dashboard has
# its own explicit rewrite below so deep-links work.

# Pretty URLs
/about   /about.html   200
/blog    /blog.html    200
/contact /contact.html 200

# Admin: explicit dashboard deep-link. /admin/ and /admin/index.html
# resolve via the static file lookup (login page).
/admin/dashboard      /admin/dashboard.html 200
/admin/dashboard.html /admin/dashboard.html 200